# 📝 Real-Life Problems

## Problem 1: Even or Odd

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func main() {
    number := 10

    if number%2 == 0 {
        fmt.Println("Even Number")
    } else {
        fmt.Println("Odd Number")
    }
}
```

---

## Problem 2: Largest of Two Numbers

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func main() {
    a := 15
    b := 20

    if a > b {
        fmt.Println("A is Largest")
    } else {
        fmt.Println("B is Largest")
    }
}
```

