# 📊 Difference Between if-else and switch

| if-else                     | switch                    |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------- |
| Used for conditions         | Used for multiple choices |
| More flexible               | Cleaner for many cases    |
| Can use complex expressions | Best for fixed values     |

